# Allowlist ONLY these hosts. One host per line, matched as an FQDN
# (see tinyproxy.conf: FilterExtended On).
# 1. The upstream Metro Train GTFS-Realtime gateway (2a).
^api\.opendata\.transport\.vic\.gov\.au$
# 2. The external dead-man's-switch ping target (2b) — deliberate, narrow
# widening confirmed by Ronnie 2026-07-21, not the default upstream host.
^hc-ping\.com$
# 3. The static GTFS schedule portal (2c/05a) — deliberately the PLAIN
# host, not the `api.` gateway above: this is a different, unauthenticated
# CKAN endpoint on the same parent domain. Confirmed 2026-07-31 this is the
# actual download host, not a redirect target — see 05a session notes for
# the live-container verification this line depends on.
^opendata\.transport\.vic\.gov\.au$
